      "story_intro": "夜巡第一季后，联盟把哨线从雪原推进了旧萤火廊：两径萤笼接力，笼在径在、灯灭哨断。据说廊底压着季轮没写完的那页——守夜人不愿它重见光，于是把考题又加深了一寸。",
      "story_intro_en": "After the watch's first season, the league pushed its line from snowfields into the old Firefly Cloister: twin lanes passed cages from hand to hand — while the cage walks, the lane holds; one lamp out and the watch is severed. Below the floor lies a page the season round never finished; the night watch would rather not see it lit — so the exam went one inch deeper.",
      "story_outro": "萤笼在庭心会齐，像一小片提前到岗的星。廊底那页纸没被翻开，只从缝里递出半句话：下一烽，冻湖。",
      "story_outro_en": "The cages mustered at the court like stars reporting early. The buried page stayed shut, sliding up only half a sentence through the crack: next beacon — the Frozen Lake."
