      "story_intro": "冻湖是天然的三环校场：冰把每一支队伍的重量都变成回响。夜巡把蛋所立在环心，三条冰径同时试压——裂声就是计时。联盟第一次把总帐挂在湖上：谁把冰踩穿，谁就替全夜巡沉底。",
      "story_intro_en": "The frozen lake is a three-ring drill ground laid out by ice itself: every rank's weight turns to echo underfoot. The watch set the roost at the ring's heart and pressed all three ice roads at once — the cracking kept the time. For the first time the league staked its whole ledger on the lake: whoever breaks through the ice drowns the night watch entire.",
      "story_outro": "三环的裂纹在寅时互相抵消，湖面重新合拢成一面完整的鼓。鼓心传出最后一响，方向很明确：岸上的烽台。",
      "story_outro_en": "At the third watch the three rings' cracks canceled each other and the lake sealed back into one whole drum. Its last beat said only one thing, and it pointed at the shore — the beacon towers."
    },
