      "story_intro": "烽台的规矩只有一条：火种可以烫手，不能落地。两条山径上的守夜人轮流提火试阵——寒流学会了两栖，飞兵便直扑接力间隙。这一课没有塔谱可查，艾吉把塔排成了两列随时准备交出火把的样子。",
      "story_intro_en": "The beacon towers keep one rule: the seed-fire may burn the hand but must never touch the ground. Watchkeepers on two lanes relayed the flame through drill after drill — until the cold tide learned to go amphibious and flyers struck straight at the handoff gaps. No turret manual covers this lesson; Eggy arrayed the towers in two columns that always looked ready to pass the torch.",
      "story_outro": "一夜交接，火种连一个火星都没掉。烽台放行时鸣了三声号——向千窗之楼。",
      "story_outro_en": "One night of relays, not a single spark lost. The towers sounded three blasts on clearing — toward the House of a Thousand Windows."
    },
