      ],
      "story_intro": "夜巡第二次大考在极夜正中开营：冻溪的余寒、极光的斜光与墨影的旧路，各率一影重踏三条归途。联盟不再问『春天会不会来』——这一次三径上全是提灯回营的人。归途即哨线，营门即国境，艾吉站在灯列的最前面。",
      "story_intro_en": "The watch's second great exam pitched camp at the very noon of polar night: the creek's leftover cold, the aurora's slanting light and the ink-shadow's old road each led one shade down a homeward lane. The league no longer asks whether spring will come — this time all three roads are thick with keepers walking home carrying lamps. The road home is the watchline, the camp gate the border; Eggy stands at the head of the lamplit column.",
      "story_outro": "三影在营地篝火前低头，随火焰一起归座。夜巡归档第二卷，卷首写道：哨位从不画在地图尽头——画在下一个还愿意熬夜的人眼里。",
      "story_outro_en": "The three shades bowed before the campfire and took their seats in the flame. Volume two of the Night Watch closed with one line at its head: a sentinel post is never drawn at the edge of a map — it is drawn in the eyes of whoever is still willing to stay up."
    }
